      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SYNERGY (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing eighth (23.03) in a Maiden at Q Lakeside. Form from her last run is proving strong. Can discover winning form. PAW EVANESCENCE (7) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (31.22) in a Maiden at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can turn it around this time. SOLANGE (6) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (20.80) at Capalaba. Speedy beginner who can find the front despite the tricky draw. Has ability and is one of the better chances. HOT SHOT OHTANI (4) is a newcomer from the Barry Kitchener kennel. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Profiles nicely and can feature in the finish.",
